msgstr "커넥터 URL 복사"

#. translators: %s: AI app name
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:578
#, php-format
msgid "Open %s"
msgstr "%s 열기"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:580
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:630
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1823
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(새 탭에서 열림)"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:590
msgid "Turn on sign-in first:"
msgstr "먼저 로그인을 켜세요:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:591
msgid "Turn on browser sign-in"
msgstr "브라우저 로그인 켜기"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:605
msgid ""
"In the <strong>Claude</strong> desktop app, go to <code>Customize → "
"Connectors</code>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Claude</strong> 데스크톱 앱에서 <code>사용자 지정 → 커넥터</code>로 "
"이동하세요."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:606
msgid "On <code>claude.ai</code>, go to <code>Customize → Connectors</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code>claude.ai</code>에서 <code>사용자 지정 → 커넥터</code>로 이동하세요."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:609
msgid ""
"Click <strong>+ Add</strong>, then <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>+ Add</strong>를 클릭한 다음 <strong>Add custom connector</strong>를 "
"클릭하세요."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:612
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link above, click <strong>Continue</strong> and then "
"<strong>Add</strong>. If Claude asks which OAuth client to use, choose "
"<strong>Register automatically</strong>."
msgstr ""
"이름을 지정하고 위의 링크를 붙여 넣은 뒤 <strong>계속</strong>, 그다음 "
"<strong>추가</strong>를 클릭하세요. Claude가 어떤 OAuth 클라이언트를 사용할"
"지 물으면 <strong>자동 등록</strong>을 선택하세요."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:613
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link from step 1, click <strong>Continue</strong> and "
"then <strong>Add</strong>. If Claude asks which OAuth client to use, choose "
"<strong>Register automatically</strong>."
msgstr ""
"이름을 지정하고 1단계의 링크를 붙여 넣은 뒤 <strong>계속</strong>, 그다음 "
"<strong>추가</strong>를 클릭하세요. Claude가 어떤 OAuth 클라이언트를 사용할"
"지 물으면 <strong>자동 등록</strong>을 선택하세요."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:668
msgid ""
"This site runs on your computer, so the cloud connector cannot reach it. "
"Claude Desktop connects through a <strong>local bridge</strong> instead: the "
"open-source <code>mcp-remote</code> package, started with <code>npx</code> "
"(needs Node.js). It signs in in your browser, and nothing is exposed to the "
"internet."
msgstr ""
"이 사이트는 내 컴퓨터에서 실행되므로 클라우드 커넥터가 접근할 수 없습니다. 대"
"신 Claude Desktop은 <strong>로컬 브리지</strong>를 통해 연결합니다. 오픈 소"
"스 <code>mcp-remote</code> 패키지를 <code>npx</code>로 실행합니다 (Node.js 필"
"요). 로그인은 브라우저에서 이루어지며, 인터넷에 노출되는 것은 없습니다."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:670
msgid "Add the bridge to Claude Desktop"
msgstr "Claude Desktop에 브리지 추가"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:671
msgid ""
"Run this in Terminal (macOS) or PowerShell (Windows), then fully quit and "
"reopen the Claude app."
msgstr ""
"터미널(macOS) 또는 PowerShell(Windows)에서 실행한 뒤, Claude 앱을 완전히 종료"
"하고 다시 여세요."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:672
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:683
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:696
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:755
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:809
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:820
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:874
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:945
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:976
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1057
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1112
msgid "Copy setup command"
msgstr "설정 명령 복사"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:672
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:675
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:696
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:700
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:809
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:820
